# Rules shared by projects using cxx_python_rules. The python bindings
# are in cxx_python_rules/nanobind/nanobind.am.

# Automake rules for a nanobind python extension module, the nanobind
# replacement for cxx_python_rules.am. Include from the top level .am file,
# after setting:
#
#   NB_SRC              binding source files (the *_nb.cc files and the
#                       file with NB_MODULE)
#   NB_LIBADD           the C++ library the bindings wrap
#   NB_DOXYGEN_INPUT    headers to take docstrings from
#   pkgpythoncxxdir    where the python package goes
#   pkgpythoncxx_LTLIBRARIES (set, possibly empty, before this file and
#                       before adding other modules to it)
#
# The module is <package>/_bindings, with the
# python files from cxx_python_rules/ next to it. configure needs AC_NANOBIND
# (config/m4/ac_nanobind.m4).





